WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.006 --> 00:00:04.033
Your client opens their project page from WhatsApp — no app, no password.

2
00:00:04.083 --> 00:00:07.393
They approve with their name and the 6-digit code.

3
00:00:07.443 --> 00:00:12.025
Approved. You're notified straight away.

4
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:15.895
Back in Fitout, the project tells you the next step.

5
00:00:15.945 --> 00:00:20.791
Convert the approved proposal to the contract — this is the signing.

6
00:00:20.841 --> 00:00:25.670
Then add the installments: down payment, milestones, final payment.
